ty)), supported by ((democracy)) and the ideal of personal ((independence))."},{"a":"aufwärts, abwärts, Streben","b":"Life in America can move ((upward upwards)) for some, but for others it turns ((downward downwards)) despite the constant ((pursuit)) of a better future."}]}],"parentTopic":{"title":"The USA between tradition and change","path":"/../c-eng-11/topic-12-politics-culture-society-usa/topic","puid":"c-eng-11/fnyjd4"},"parentBlock":{"title":"American dream vs. American nightmare","path":"/../c-eng-11/topic-12-politics-culture-society-usa/block-01-american-nightmare/block","puid":"c-eng-11/ycgdsy"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/advantage","etag":"042e-7920"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/democracy","etag":"24ac-7344"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/downward","etag":"0498-6192"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/economic","etag":"c1ef-7200"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/independence","etag":"8275-8208"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/liberty","etag":"cbcd-6624"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/myth","etag":"dcdd-5616"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/poverty","etag":"7513-6768"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/prosperity, wealth","etag":"39ce-12384"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/pursuit","etag":"9aaa-6192"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/success","etag":"0dfa-7344"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Poly/upward","etag":"f6ce-6048"},{"fileId":"sound/en/m1Poly/Fill in the gaps translating the words below.","etag":"ca0f-18432"},{"fileId":"sound/en/m1Poly/Translate.","etag":"f1e3-7344"}],"svgs":[],"lsgs":[],"images":[{"fileId":"image/lsg_b6ccbe8520","etag":"baeb-28708","isBlockCoverImage":true}]},"etag":"2c5a-3648"}